  "title": "Onboarding in 2025",
  "summary": "Onboarding in 2025 looks nothing like the past. Previously, onboarding had been extremely costly and time-consuming. New employees were required to sit through long, boring presentations where most of the time, the information would go in one ear and out the other. Managers had to spend hours answering the same questions over and over again. Training materials were often outdated, causing these sessions to be extended. The whole system was frustrating for companies, managers, and new staff. Change needed to occur.",
